# One retained Aurora namespace owner per @case; @revision defaults to 1.
# Each row is REQUEST => EXPECTED. Words are: tag [cursor [count [payload]]].
# Payload is an integer or up to four quoted bytes, least-significant byte first.
# Omitted fields are zero; raw preserves malformed full-width words.
# cancel invokes the owner cancellation method. Replies are always explicit.

